  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Dunamis Aesthetic**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on defining the \"Canaari\" aesthetic. I\'m investigating what visual cues and design principles are key to the look. The user\'s request hints at a desire for a vibrant, Dunamis-level website, so color palettes and creative elements are top of mind. Right now, I need to figure out the actual Dunamis, so I can start extracting the visual cues.\n\n\n**Refining the Color Palette**\n\nI\'m now diving deeper into specific color combinations, especially around a bright \"Canary\" yellow, looking for high-contrast pairings like charcoal with vibrant yellow or neon green. I\'m also exploring bold typography choices, and playful geometric elements to create an expressive design. Dark mode and colorful sections are also being considered to ensure visual variety.\n\n\n**Updating the Style Choices**\n\nI\'m now revising my plans to work on the visual style. I\'m focusing on defining the dark theme, light theme and accent colors. I\'m going to start by editing the variables in `globals.css` with a strong canary yellow, and I\'ll explore both dark and light mode for Dunamis use.\n\n\n**Designing the Visual System**\n\nI\'m now putting together the design system. I\'ve chosen a warm off-white background, sharp black foreground, and electric canary yellow as the accent color. I\'m thinking of bolder typography for headings, playing with tracking and font weights. I\'m focusing on homepage layout, color blocks, shapes, and updating page components with these style changes.\n\n\n**Implementing the Canary Design**\n\nI\'m now deep in implementation, and I\'m updating `globals.css` with a warm off-white, deep black, and vibrant Canary yellow as core colors. I\'m considering rounded corners for certain elements, juxtaposing them with sharp edges elsewhere for visual interest. I\'m focusing on hover effects, particularly buttons filling with yellow, and quirky borders or shadows for images. I also plan to create full canary yellow sections!\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 13
      nanos: 20111588
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
